   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.1, independent of the author), round 1 on f4c5ab31: REQUEST CHANGES**\n\n1. Medium, `docs/THEMES.md:80`: Noël windows differ from the operator's words (arrival 01/12–24/12, switch-on « le 01/12 »; 25–26/12 and the packing bounds are not his words).\n2. Medium, `docs/ICONS.md:42`: states a `#F18F18` reading and \"the forum stylesheets have no orange\" while the stylesheets are pending capture (#728).\n3. Low: FEAT-010.md says LOT-180 is M4, LOTS.md still lists it under M5.\n4. Low: « [Oui] [Garder] », \"ink contours\", the plain \"X-face\" and \"Coucher de soleil\" are not in the operator's requests.\n5. Low: Hiver icon follows the 10:09 direction the operator walked back at 15:40; Samain « je prends le 01/11 » not quoted.\n6. Low (orchestrator): LOT-166 row vs #256 labels; lot issues cite wrong section numbers.\n7. Detail: « par ezzz » vs « par Ezzz ».\n\n**Fixed in 8c0d4f31**\n1. Partly disputed, then fixed: the 25–26/12 arrival and the 7-day packing bound are not invented, they are the operator's answers Q2 and Q3 of 2026-10-28 (decisions table of the design session: « oui ta reco — on laisse l'animation néanmoins », « ok ta reco »). The row now quotes his words and names Q2/Q3, marked *(to confirm)* where they extend them.\n2. Fixed: no value before #728.\n3. Fixed by not stating a milestone in FEAT-010.md: LOT-180's own PR (#420) moves its row.\n4. Fixed: marked as proposals *(to confirm)*; Q4 cited for « Revenir à l'icône précédente ? ».\n5. Fixed: scarf icon keeps the earlier version per his 15:40 words; 01/11 quoted.\n6. Section numbers fixed on #731, #732, #733, #735. #256's labels and body wait for the operator (editing that issue is held for confirmation).\n7. Fixed.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
